      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Do you have an XL Avalugg that my four Bergmite\ncan ride on?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F00200079006F00750020006800610076006500200061006E00200058004C0020004100760061006C007500670067002000740068006100740020006D007900200066006F0075007200200042006500720067006D006900740065000A00630061006E002000720069006400650020006F006E003F001000020114018B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just as a reminder, I’m looking for an Avalugg big\nenough to fit my four Bergmite babies on its back.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nAn XL-sized Avalugg, to be exact!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 143
    },
    {
      "displayText": "That one’s not quite big enough...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nI don’t think anything less than an XL Avalugg\nhas enough room to fit all four of my Bergmite.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 137
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m really sorry, but a Hisuian Avalugg’s not\nexactly what I’m going for.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƋ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
